														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4345312">
									

<p>This one stewed with me for a few hours. I hope my ultimate reason for upvoting isn't interpreted as denigrating; your work is an inspiration, kaktus. I wasn't really touched by this one because&#8230; I don't know, for the subject matter and message it felt hollow, or too easy. But it's still a very worthy message to convey. I've given it a +1 just for that.</p>
<p>I do feel like the idea itself, as an SCP, is good, but the execution is unclear in its details, and it's muddied by what's left unsaid. Sometimes that's great, but in this case I feel like being overly blunt isn't so bad when you've taken the step of literally damning someone to hell (deservedly). For the message itself, in any form, this should succeed. Too few people think about what has been done to too many in such clothing.</p>
<p>Again, I love what you write and hope this isn't construed as too negative :)</p>

							</div>

								
					
